    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200b&quot;Drowning in Her Sea&quot; \u2014 A Dark Whisper of Submersion\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, it was tender, like the warmth of her fingertips. Then it became a weight, pressing against the chest, slowly filling the lungs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You write back and forth between two names, the ink bleeding, blurring into a bruise of blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She asks what love is. You give an answer. The answer becomes another question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The screen flickers occasionally, like a broken lighthouse. Save points scatter like buoys\u2014each one you cling to pulls you deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Press X to keep sinking)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Press O to stop breathing)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not a game about choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is about how water learns to become a grave.</p>",
